Topi already covered the pet aspect: just step on the portal with the
pet adjacent and it will come along (like going up/down stairs). So no
need to do funny business to get the pet to come along.

About ludios & the alarm: it always says that when you enter ludios.
The soldiers all do run and mob the door, but you've got that locked
door to keep them at bay until you want to unlock it. Using the
doorway is a good way to fight only one (or two) soldiers at a time.
Stay out of wand striking range as much as you can. A soldier with a /
oDeath could insta-kill you at this point.

About castle: yeah, i'd go to the castle first and wish up some MR
when you get the wand. You can always clear out the castle using the
bridge with relative safety (always be careful of the occasional
minotaur or purple L on the castle level). You can watch Shawn "The
Cheater" Moore's instructional ttyrec on the subject if you've never
done the castle bridge thing before.

